{"path":"string/basic_string/begin","title":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::begin, std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::cbegin","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>begin, <span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::basic_string&lt;CharT,Traits,Allocator&gt;::</span>cbegin","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/string/basic_string/begin","section":"string","kind":"page","summary":"Returns an iterator to the first character of the string.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">iterator begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_iterator begin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(noexcept since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx11\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td><div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">const_iterator cbegin<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"kw1\">noexcept</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3)</td>\n<td><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(since C++11)</span> <br><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(constexpr since C++20)</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns an iterator to the first character of the string.\n</p><p><code>begin()</code> returns a <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator\">mutable</a> or <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator\">constant</a> iterator, depending on the constness of <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this</span></code>.\n</p><p><code>cbegin()</code> always returns a <a href=\"/w/cpp/iterator\">constant</a> iterator. It is equivalent to <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">const_cast</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> basic_string<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this<span class=\"br0\">)</span>.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-image\">\n<p><img alt=\"range-begin-end.svg\" src=\"/cppreference/images/1/1b/range-begin-end.svg\" width=\"546\" height=\"157\">\n</p>\n</div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>Iterator to the first character.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Complexity\">Complexity</h3>\n<p>Constant.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Notes\">Notes</h3>\n<p>libc++ backports <code>cbegin()</code> to C++98 mode.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"cpp\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;iostream&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;string&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> s<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"Exemplar\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>s.<span class=\"me1\">begin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">'e'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> s <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> i <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> s.<span class=\"me1\">cbegin</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"sy2\">*</span>i <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"co1\">//  *i = 'E'; // error: i is a constant iterator</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>exemplar\ne</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string/end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>end</span><span>cend</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span></span><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx11\">(C++11)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the end <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span><span>cbegin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Complexity","id":"Complexity"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string","title":"std::basic_string"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::begin, std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::cbegin","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations; revisions: since C++11. Returns an iterator to the first character of the string."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"Iterator to the first character."},{"label":"Complexity","note":"Constant."},{"label":"Notes","note":"libc++ backports cbegin() to C++98 mode."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"end, cend","note":"returns an iterator to the end"},{"label":"begin, cbegin","note":"returns an iterator to the beginning"}]}]},"standards":["C++11","C++20"],"wordCount":148,"codeBlockCount":2}
